==Battleground==
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*30 [[Demon Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*4 [[Demon Doge]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

